title: FirstLoopDeniz
tags:
---
<<LightOff Deniz>>
<<if DoesHeKnow ("SecondLoop") == true>>
	<<jump SecondLoopDeniz>>
<<endif>>

<<if DoesHeKnow("DenizSetting")>>	
	(Enter DENIZ CANSEL)
<<else>>
	<< Learn DenizSetting>>
	SETTING - A side-alley in Nauka square. Far away from the hustle and bustle of the parade just a few streets further.

	AT RISE - There's someone sitting by the edge of the water that SASHA hasn't met before. A small, [i]adorable[/i] white dog by their side. It wags its tail with a ferocity that shakes its body.

	NARRATOR: You don’t remember there being many dogs in Solster, is it an import?

	(The person looks up. Sasha does not recognize them, but knows DMITRIY is familiar with them.)

	<<set $SeenDenizIntro = true>>

	<<if DoesHeKnow("DenizTarot") == true>>
		NARRATOR: Then, you remember. This is who the doctor mentioned before, wasn’t it? Deniz Cansel.
	<<else>>
		<< Learn DenizTarot >>
		<< Learn DenizInfoA >> //One of the local doctors
	<<endif>>
<<endif>>

-> "Who are you?"
	SASHA: "Who are you?"
	DENIZ: (slowly) Deniz.
	(A long silence falls. DENIZ stares at you.)
-> "Hello."
	SASHA: "Hello."
	(DENIZ nods.)

-> "Cute dog."
	SASHA: "Cute dog."
	(They nod.)
		-> What's her name?
		SASHA: "What's her name?"
		DENIZ: She’s not mine.
			-> Then whose is it?
				SASHA: "Then whose is it?"
				DENIZ: (hesitantly) I don’t wanna talk about it.
				-> "What?"
					SASHA: "What?"
					DENIZ: Stop asking me stupid questions.
						-> What???
							SASHA: "What??"
						-> Excuse me?
							SASHA: "Excuse me?"
						-> Checks out.
							SASHA: "Checks out."
				->Got it.
					SASHA: "Got it."
			-> Oh, okay.
				SASHA: "Oh, okay."
		-> "Alrighty then."
			SASHA: "Alrighty then."
-> Are you a doctor?
	SASHA: "Are you a doctor?"
	(DENIZ is dressed oddly. Wearing one half of a medical coat, and another half of a trench coat. The fabrics are a horrifying sight.)
	<<if $ArtMajor == true>>
		ART: Yet, it's a wondrous example of impeccable fashion design.
	<<elseif $TechMajor == true>>
		TECH: This.. is awful. Who okayed this?
	<<elseif $PsychMajor == true>>
		PSY: At the very least, the artist who made it it must have a wondrous personality.. or a terrible manic episode.
	<<endif>>
	(DENIZ nods, they look you up and down the same way you are, as if checking for injuries.)

DENIZ: Do you need something?
-> Why are you sitting all the way out here?
	SASHA: "Why are you sitting all the way out here?"
	(They shrug, the move long and languid. As if they’re trying to very unsubtly show their disinterest in the conversation.)
	<<if $PsychMajor == true>>
		PSY: They probably just came here to sit alone.
	<<endif>>
	-> Gotcha.
	-> See you around.
-> Nope, sorry for bothering.

