	(Enter DENIZ CANSEL)
<<else>>
	<< Learn DenizSetting>>
	SETTING - A side-alley in Nauka square. Far away from the hustle and bustle of the parade just a few streets further.

	AT RISE - There's someone sitting by the edge of the water that SASHA hasn't met before. A small, [i]adorable[/i] white dog by their side. It wags its tail with a ferocity that shakes its body.

	NARRATOR: You don’t remember there being many dogs in Solster, is it an import?

	(The person looks up. Sasha does not recognize them, but knows DMITRIY is familiar with them.)

