-> Are you a doctor?
	SASHA: "Are you a doctor?"
	(DENIZ is dressed oddly even for this town's standards. Wearing one half of a medical coat, and another half of a trench coat. The fabrics are a horrifying sight.)
	<<if $ArtMajor == true>>
